 reader seam, TTY/empty → empty_stdin before any SDK call) and list-events made real. A fixtures-exempt test seam (setIntakeWalkHook) induces real mid-walk failures by closing the handle inside the transaction. Closed Story 1's TC-1.4 deferral. Red manifest recorded for the four new suites plus the two updated Red files before gates ran.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/artifacts/02-event-recording-validation-idempotency/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:434:        reason: \"Event table added to thread-file schema v1 migration (event storage lands at creation)\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/artifacts/02-event-recording-validation-idempotency/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:499:        - \"Initial payload-schema dispatch used unsafe Schema<unknown,unknown> casts — replaced with a typed per-kind switch and a generic decodeIssue helper\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/artifacts/02-event-recording-validation-idempotency/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:531:  version: 1\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/artifacts/03-message-projection-tokens/001-story-validate.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-orchestrate validate\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"ready\",\"result\":{\"status\":\"ready\",\"storyId\":\"03-message-projection-tokens\",\"storyRunSelection\":{\"case\":\"start-new\"},\"validatedConfig\":{\"version\":1,\"primary_harness\":\"claude-code\",\"story_implementor\":{\"secondary_harness\":\"none\",\"model\":\"claude-fable-5\",\"reasoning_effort\":\"medium\"},\"story_lead_provider\":{\"secondary_harness\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.5\",\"reasoning_effort\":\"high\"},\"quick_fixer\":{\"secondary_harness\":\"none\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-8\",\"reasoning_effort\":\"xhigh\"},\"story_verifier\":{\"secondary_harness\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.5\",\"reasoning_effort\":\"xhigh\"},\"self_review\":{\"passes\":3},\"epic_verifiers\":[{\"s